>> title: Simple Marinara
>> servings: 4
>> time: 30 minutes
>> tags: familiar, watchme, stovetop, sauce, heartbeat

-- watch: Garlic smells fragrant and stays pale, with no brown edges.
Warm @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #saucepan{} and gently cook @garlic{3%cloves} for ~{2%minutes}.

Add @crushed tomatoes{28%oz}, @kosher salt{1%tsp}, and @sugar{1%pinch}; stir with a #wooden spoon{}.

-- watch: Sauce bubbles gently, not in violent bursts.
Simmer uncovered over low heat for ~{20%minutes}, stirring occasionally.

-- watch: Sauce coats a spoon and leaves a brief trail when stirred.
Cook until thickened, then taste and adjust with @kosher salt{}.

Tear in @basil leaves{8} and finish with @olive oil{1%tbsp}.
